插画背景结合。\n画面构图与元素：\n\n- 整体底色为深藏青色，边缘带细金色装饰边框，构图对称规整，元素分区清晰不杂乱\n- 正中心放置银质马头吊坠，为画面绝对视觉焦点\n- 顶部：左右对称分布 4 枚铜棕色圆形传统蜡染纹样徽章；中央是米黄色衬线字体「The Vibrant July Edition」，两侧分别标注小字「Master Craftsman」与「Dong Charn」\n- 左侧区域：竖向拼接多块民族几何纹样，包含深绿波浪纹、土黄锯齿纹、砖红底菱形花鸟纹\n- 右侧区域：扁平化热带海滩日落场景，黄色圆日、层叠海浪、浅米色沙滩，搭配橙红色珊瑚图形\n- 底部区域：分布扁平化热带绿植与珊瑚图案，右下角点缀菱形民族纹样徽章；中央是米黄色文字，上方为小字「The Vibrant July Edition」，下方为大号衬线字体「OROLA」\n整体质感：复古低饱和度配色，画面带有轻微纸张印刷肌理，银饰保留真实金属磨砂质感，与扁平背景形成层次对比。", "empty", false, 994797072, "randomize", "1k"], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 2, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image10", "label": "image10", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image10"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"}, {"widget": {"name": "